===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|eruditio||an instructing, learning, erudition}}<!--Or "erudition"?-->, from {{m|la|erudire||to instruct, educate, cultivate|lit=free from rudeness}}, from {{m|la|e||out}} + {{m|la|rudis||rude}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˌeɹʊˈdɪʃən/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# [[profound|Profound]] [[knowledge]], especially that based on [[learning]] and [[scholarship]].

